# Testing and evals

- Deterministic correctness tests come before subjective model judgments.
- Every AI behavior change requires a corresponding eval or test fixture.
- Citation validation and learner-evidence validation must remain deterministic and 100% valid.
- Live model evals are opt-in and excluded from ordinary CI.
- Evaluation results compare against committed baselines; do not weaken thresholds just to pass CI.
- Prefer AI SDK mock providers for unit/integration/CI.
